<mxCell id="n2" value="&lt;b&gt;LangGraph Agent Loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• StateGraph con 5 nodos + decision diamond&lt;br&gt;• Max 10 iteraciones (tool calls) por request&lt;br&gt;• Circuit breaker: 3 errores consecutivos → graceful degradation&lt;br&gt;• Dynamic tool selection: máx 8 tools filtradas por query keywords&lt;br&gt;• Context budget: 80k tokens msgs + 2.2k memory + 3.5k artifacts" style="shape=note;size=15;fillColor=#FFFFCC;strokeColor=#B3B300;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="280" width="330" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
